        "ActivityDes": "Requirements:\\nCommandant Lv.40\\nEvent Info:\\n1. The [Phantom Clash] mode is open for a limited time. Use existing save files to match and battle other Commandants in [Phantom Clash] mode.\\n2. [Nightshroud Tales] features new Kamui story. Enter the event interface and tap [Nightshroud Tales] to experience it.\\n3. [Labyrinth Breakout] adds Difficulty 5, which can be unlocked after reaching a certain rank in [Phantom Clash] mode;\\n4. [Omniscient Vision] gains additional levels and effects, providing extra bonuses obtainable in [Labyrinth Breakout] mode;\\n5. Permanent Shop inventory has been updated. Spend permanent tokens to exchange for rewards such as [Stamps] and [R&D Tickets].\\n6. A limited-time shop will also be open during the event period. Complete limited-time missions during the event to earn limited-time tokens, which can be exchanged for rewards such as [R&D Tickets] in the limited-time shop.\\n7. Increasing your rank in [Phantom Clash] mode will earn you [Collectibles] and other rewards.",
